          <tbody>
            <tr><td class="band"><a href="/calculators/">Calculators</a></td><td>Finance, math, statistics, STEM, and everyday conversions</td><td>GPA, statistics suite, unit and currency converter</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band"><a href="/career-toolkit/">Career Toolkit</a></td><td>Resumes, cover letters, and writing tools</td><td>Resume Builder, Cover Letter Builder, Word Counter</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="band"><a href="/developer-toolbox/">Developer Toolbox</a></td><td>Formatters, converters, generators, and testers</td><td>JSON Formatter, Regex Tester, Diff Checker</td></tr>
