        <div class="cav">No catch here</div>
        <h2 id="free">How is everything free?</h2>
        <p>Best Answer Hub carries no ads, no affiliate links, and no data sale. The free tools stay free because they run on your device, so there is no per-use server cost to recover. What keeps the lights on is the Knowledge Center: a small set of optional, one-time paid assessments for people who want a deeper report. The free tools and the free assessments never depend on a purchase, and nothing about a tool changes whether you buy anything or not.</p>
